'''''Pittosporum coriaceum''''' is a species of [[plant]] in the [[Pittosporaceae]] family. It is [[Endemism|endemic]] to [[Macaronesia]], and due to extinction in the [[Canary Islands]], it is now restricted to the [[Portugal|Portuguese]] [[Madeira Islands]].

''Pittosporum coriaceum'' is a [[Critically endangered species]] due to [[habitat loss]].

